      "text": "My Youth in Middle School"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "For me, puberty came early, but I did not have many problems with this."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My life at this time of life was similar to others."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I was really interested in listening to music and watching movies."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I was trying to work hard in school, so I could get into a good high school, but I had a very hard time doing so."
